WEBVTT

00:01:59.024 --> 00:02:00.160
i možda biti premijer

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.156
i sve je moguće, znate.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:06.556
(Smijeh)

00:02:06.556 --> 00:02:09.605
Tako da o tome mogu sada pričati

00:02:09.605 --> 00:02:13.427
jer sam dosegla ovu točku, gdje —

00:02:13.427 --> 00:02:17.367
mislim, imam 28 godina.

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:19.857
Sigurna sam da sam sad odrasla.

00:02:19.857 --> 00:02:21.679
(Smijeh)

00:02:21.679 --> 00:02:23.681
I odrasla sam žena

00:02:23.681 --> 00:02:27.757
koja provodi vrijeme kao izvođač,

00:02:27.757 --> 00:02:30.659
s govornom manom.